 gateway/platforms/api_server_openai_routes.py | 11 +++-
 tests/gateway/test_api_server_thread_hops.py  | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/gateway/test_api_server_thread_hops.py

